  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Thread Brussels sprouts and chorizo sausage onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, salt, black pepper, and paprika.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 2 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
